```
Example: Agent calls a 10-credit skill (using canonical 5-tier boundaries)

avoid  (0-19,  2x premium): Agent pays 20cr   → 17cr creator, 3cr protocol
new    (20-39, base price):  Agent pays 10cr   → 8.5cr creator, 1.5cr protocol
